jobs.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;GitLab is the intelligent orchestration platform for DevSecOps. GitLab enables organizations to increase developer productivity, improve operational efficiency, reduce security and compliance risk, and accelerate digital transformation. More than 50 million registered users and more than 50% of the Fortune 100* trust GitLab to ship better, more secure software faster.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The same principles built into our products are reflected in how our team works: we embrace AI as a core productivity multiplier, with all team members expected to incorporate AI into their daily workflows to drive efficiency, innovation, and impact. GitLab is where careers accelerate, innovation flourishes, and every voice is valued. Our high-performance culture is driven by our values&amp;nbsp;and continuous knowledge exchange, enabling our team members to reach their full potential while collaborating with industry leaders to solve complex problems. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OuZIb5zszQI&quot;&gt;Co-create the future with us&lt;/a&gt; as we build technology that transforms how the world develops software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;*&lt;em&gt;Fortune 500® is a registered trademark of Fortune Media IP Limited, used under license. Claim based on GitLab data. Fortune 100 refers to the top 20% ranked companies in the 2025 Fortune 500 list, published in June 2025. Fortune and Fortune Media IP Limited are not affiliated with, and do not endorse products or services of GitLab.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An overview of this role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Partner Solutions Manager, Strategic Partnerships, you&#39;ll own the technical strategy and validation of joint work with GitLab&#39;s strategic partners: hyperscalers, artificial intelligence (AI) labs, AI-native companies, and development, security, and operations (DevSecOps) vendors. You&#39;ll work with partners, Product, and Research and Development (R&amp;amp;D) to turn partner and customer needs into integrations, influence product design, and build the business case for each joint effort, from the first architecture review to a shipped integration. In this role you will also own the AI model evaluation process with our model partners, working closely with our R&amp;amp;D teams to assess new models ahead of release and ensure GitLab is built on the best-performing models for our customers. Unlike a customer-facing Solutions Architect role focused on adoption, you&#39;ll work with partners to make GitLab better. This role has no sales quota or variable pay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At GitLab, our mission is simple: to enable everyone to contribute to and co-create the software that powers our world. Our platform doesn&#39;t just bring people together-it unites teams and organizations, breaking down barriers and redefining what&#39;s possible in software development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end technical strategy for assigned strategic partners, connecting technical requirements with joint business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn partner technology and roadmaps into integration, architecture, and product opportunities across the GitLab platform, from planning to monitoring and AI agents and model integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve complex technical issues across GitLab and partner systems, including cloud architecture, tool integrations, and AI model and agent evaluation and integration. Build working prototypes to validate concepts with partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the end-to-end AI model evaluation process with our model partners, coordinating with R&amp;amp;D to secure early access, align on evaluation criteria and timelines, and translate results into partnership and product roadmap decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and facilitate partner workshops, architecture reviews, and cloud financial management (FinOps) sessions, bringing in the right participants and documenting outcomes and next steps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build business cases for joint technical efforts, defining expected gains, costs, and resources, and securing agreement from partner managers, R&amp;amp;D, and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring partner requirements and technical feedback into Product and R&amp;amp;D discussions to influence product design and the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate Engineering, Product, FinOps, Finance, Sales, and Marketing with partner technical teams to move joint work from evaluation to delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track cloud, AI, and DevSecOps developments to advise partnership investment, and share reusable findings through documentation, the handbook, reference architectures, and technical content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience as a Senior Solutions Architect, Partner Solutions Architect, Partner Engineer, or in a similar senior technical role. Experience with technology partners or alliances is strongly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An end-to-end understanding of the software development lifecycle, continuous integration and continuous delivery (CI/CD), and DevSecOps, with the ability to use GitLab in depth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on cloud architecture experience with at least one hyperscaler: Google Cloud, Amazon Web Services (AWS), or Microsoft Azure. Cloud cost or FinOps experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of AI model evaluation frameworks and agent technology, including large language model (LLM) application programming interfaces (APIs), agent frameworks, and Model Context Protocol (MCP), and how they fit into developer workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and facilitating technical workshops with senior technical and business stakeholders, and building business cases that scope work, estimate gains and costs, and size resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An autonomous, ownership-driven approach: you identify work and move it forward without waiting for a project backlog.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear, concise written and spoken communication, adapting technical and commercial trade-offs for audiences from engineers to executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel about once a quarter and work hours that overlap with Europe, the Middle East, and Africa (EMEA). If you&#39;re on the US West Coast, expect to start around 7 a.m. Pacific Time; when the day ends is flexible.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll join Strategic Partnerships and report to the VP, Corporate Development and Strategic Partnerships. The team manages GitLab&#39;s relationships with hyperscalers, AI companies, and select DevSecOps companies, acting as the business owner and coordinating work across hosting contracts, product integrations, go-to-market activities, purchasing, and partner-specific marketing. Partner managers and directors lead each relationship; you&#39;ll own the technical side across partner types and collaborate with R&amp;amp;D, Engineering, FinOps, Finance, Sales, and Marketing. The role is remote, with Eastern Time preferred and other US time zones possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab will support you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/paid-time-off/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/erg-guide/#:~:text=Definition%20of%20the%20TMRG%20%2D%20Team%20Member%20Resource%20Groups,-TMRGs%20are%20voluntary&amp;amp;text=The%20purpose%20for%20this%20type,developing%20the%20sense%20of%20belonging.&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Parental leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/finance/expenses/#equipment&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Home office&lt;/a&gt; support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The base salary range for this role’s listed level is currently for residents of the&amp;nbsp;United States only. This range is intended to reflect the role&#39;s base salary rate in locations throughout the US.&amp;nbsp;Grade level and salary ranges are determined through interviews and a review of education, experience, knowledge, skills, abilities of the applicant, equity with other team members, alignment with market data,&amp;nbsp;and geographic location.&amp;nbsp;The base salary range does not include any bonuses, equity, or benefits. See more information on our &lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLBeneUS&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;benefits&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:none;font-family:&#39;Arial&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt; and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;waffle-rich-text-link&quot; href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/stock-options/&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-link=&quot;https://bit.ly/GLequity&quot; data-sheets-formula-bar-text-style=&quot;font-size:12px;color:#1155cc;font-weight:normal;text-decoration:underline;font-family:&#39;&#39;Arial&#39;&#39;;font-style:normal;text-decoration-skip-ink:none;&quot;&gt;equity&lt;/a&gt;. Sales roles are also eligible for incentive pay targeted at up to 100% of the offered base salary.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;United States Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$115,200&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$194,400 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How GitLab Supports Full-Time Employees&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/&quot;&gt;Benefits to support your health, finances, and well-being&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/time-off-and-absence/time-off-types/#flexible-paid-time-off-pto&quot;&gt;Flexible Paid Time Off&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/company/culture/inclusion/tmrg-tmag/&quot;&gt;Team Member Resource Groups&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/stock-options/&quot;&gt;Equity Compensation &amp;amp; Employee Stock Purchase Plan&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/people-group/learning-and-development/growth-and-development/&quot;&gt;Growth and Development Fund&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/total-rewards/benefits/general-and-entity-benefits/#parental-leave&quot;&gt;Parental Leave&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please note that we welcome interest from candidates with varying levels of experience; many successful candidates do not meet every single requirement. Additionally, studies have shown that people from &lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/company/culture/inclusion/#examples-of-select-underrepresented-groups&quot;&gt;underrepresented groups&lt;/a&gt; are less likely to apply to a job unless they meet every single qualification. If you&#39;re excited about this role, please apply and allow our recruiters to assess your application.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Country Hiring Guidelines: &lt;/strong&gt;GitLab hires new team members in countries around the world. All of our roles are remote, however some roles may carry specific location-based eligibility requirements. Our Talent Acquisition team can help answer any questions about location after starting the recruiting process.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Policy: &lt;/strong&gt;Please review our &lt;a href=&quot;https://handbook.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/candidate-faq/recruitment-privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Recruitment Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; Your privacy is important to us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GitLab is proud to be an equal opportunity workplace and is an affirmative action employer. GitLab’s policies and practices relating to recruitment, employment, career development and advancement, promotion, and retirement are based solely on merit, regardless of race, color, religion, ancestry, sex (including pregnancy, lactation, sexual orientation, gender identity, or gender expression), national origin, age, citizenship, marital status, mental or physical disability, genetic information (including family medical history), discharge status from the military, protected veteran status (which includes disabled veterans, recently separated veterans, active duty wartime or campaign badge veterans, and Armed Forces service medal veterans), or any other basis protected by law. GitLab will not tolerate discrimination or harassment based on any of these characteristics. See also&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#equal-employment-opportunity-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;GitLab’s EEO Policy&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/labor-and-employment-notices/#eeoc-us-equal-employment-opportunity-commission-notices&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law&lt;/a&gt;. If you have a disability or special need that requires&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/people-policies/inc-usa/#reasonable-accommodation&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;accommodation&lt;/a&gt;, please let us know during the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://about.gitlab.com/handbook/hiring/interviewing/#adjustments-to-our-interview-process&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;recruiting process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Core skills: &lt;/strong&gt;business development, new logo acquisition, strategic account management, cross-sell, video infrastructure, executive engagement, pipeline generation, enterprise closing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;is an award-winning video streaming technology to world-renowned brands and managed service providers. Our solution suite consists of Live and VOD Encoding, a Multi-Platform Player, and Analytics platform; enabling content owners to redefine the viewer experience through API-based workflow optimization, fast turnaround, and scalability.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have seen great success and created great momentum in the market. This is down to our products, ecosystem, but ultimately our people who love video streaming and helping customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;“We’re building the future of video streaming across EMEA - combining high-impact hunting with strategic account growth to deliver unmatched commercial results. If you’re ready to help shape the industry and make a real impact, join us.”&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;Barney Withers Green, SVP, Sales &amp;amp; Business Development, EMEA &amp;amp; APAC&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At &lt;strong&gt;Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;we value cognitive diversity and the huge part this plays in not only creating a global culture second to none, but in how this underpins our ability to create truly representative, Emmy award winning products. Diversity in all its forms is encouraged and celebrated at Bitmovin; everyone has a role to play in helping us shape the future of video.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why us?&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt; is rapidly growing with significant market opportunity, and we are looking for talented and self driven individuals to take Bitmovin to the next level.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Following an exciting evolution of our commercial structure, we are seeking an exceptional, commercially driven Sales Director to accelerate revenue growth, develop strategic opportunities, and strengthen our presence across key EMEA markets.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This role uniquely combines high-impact new business development with strategic ownership of key customer relationships. Supported by designated Account Managers and Customer Success resources for day-to-day management, you will be empowered to focus on winning new logos, driving strategic cross-sell, and engaging executives across the region. With our full support and coaching, you will pave your own path, collaborating with our global teams to shape the future of media and streaming.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity that offers:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to shape the streaming and video technology strategies of leading EMEA Media &amp;amp; Entertainment companies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hybrid role balancing high-velocity new business acquisition with strategic key account ownership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Selling market-leading products (Live Encoding, VOD Encoding, Player, Observability) alongside top Cloud Partners and System Integrators&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Autonomy, international collaboration, flexible working, and regional travel (~50%).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As Director, Sales &amp;amp; Key Accounts, you will be at the forefront of powering the next generation of digital video across EMEA. Your mission is to fuel Bitmovin’s expansion by acquiring game-changing new logos and driving high-value strategic growth across priority markets, including the UK, DACH, and selected CEE &amp;amp; MENA regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating within the global GTM and partner strategy to define and execute local initiatives in media, streaming, and OTT markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving direct enterprise sales with full sales cycle ownership, including multi-year SaaS agreements and platform licensing deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling customers to adopt Bitmovin solutions in the way that best fits their business — direct, partner-led, or cloud/video platform routes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying, onboarding, and enabling local partners to drive net-new revenue and new customer wins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborating with local and global teams (solutions engineering, customer success, partner teams) to support adoption and partner success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing market insights, competitor intelligence, and recommendations on product, pricing, and GTM strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking pipeline, revenue, and partner acquisition KPIs to measure impact and improve conversion rates across channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What competencies can you bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry Expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven success selling software/technology into broadcasters, OTT platforms, or video infrastructure (CDN, adtech, broadcast tech)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive &amp;amp; Accountability: &lt;/strong&gt;Track record of originating, closing complex enterprise sales, and consistently exceeding revenue goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Building: &lt;/strong&gt;Established network of technical and commercial decision-makers across EMEA media and streaming ecosystems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Acumen: &lt;/strong&gt;Solid grasp of streaming workflows, technical ecosystems, and enterprise buying processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Proactive Ownership: &lt;/strong&gt;Self-driven, highly autonomous pipeline builder focused on results and execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Influence: &lt;/strong&gt;Confident navigating high-value negotiations and engaging senior executive stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaboration &amp;amp; Adaptability: &lt;/strong&gt;Open to feedback and skilled at partnering across cross-functional teams to drive collective success&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 6 Months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish strong relationships with priority customers, prospects, and internal stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build a clear territory plan and strategic business development roadmaps for target regions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a healthy, self-generated pipeline of qualified opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify and progress strategic cross-sell opportunities within assigned key accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;First 12 Months:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver against agreed net-new ARR and strategic cross-sell targets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate consistent pipeline generation and enterprise deal progression&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish meaningful new customer relationships across priority EMEA markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong executive engagement and strategic oversight of assigned key accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate independently with rigorous forecasting discipline and commercial accountability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t have experience with all the points above? Don’t worry, we will support you with learning, training, and coaching on the job.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at Bitmovin&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Find out more about us on our&lt;a href=&quot;https://bitmovin.com/careers/&quot;&gt; Careers Page&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;See what fellow Bitmovers are saying on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/bitmovin/life/7f143265-8cc2-4ae8-93f4-dc88cf00d0d4/?viewAsMember=true&quot;&gt; LinkedIn&lt;br&gt;&lt;/a&gt;Check the employee reviews on&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.co.uk/Reviews/Bitmovin-Reviews-E1400248.htm&quot;&gt; Glassdoor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For all of our roles, we are willing to discuss flexible working arrangements to support everyone’s unique circumstances.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi Deliveroo ?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lorsque l&#39;on vous dit Deliveroo, vous imaginez sans doute d&#39;abord les bons petits plats livrés chez vous en moins d&#39;une demi-heure. Plutôt sympa non ? Mais c&#39;est en coulisses que l&#39;histoire est la plus intéressante. Nous opérons désormais à travers le monde et travaillons avec plus de 176 000 restaurants partenaires et commerces en tous genres en France. Nous collaborons avec des milliers de livreurs et de livreuses partenaires pour le plus grand bonheur de nos millions de personnes clientes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous recherchons un·e Assistant·e Chef de Projet Marketing Merchant en alternance pour rejoindre notre équipe Marketing à Paris, pour une durée de 12 mois. Aux côtés de l&#39;équipe Merchant, vous contribuerez au développement de la croissance de nos partenaires, au déploiement de nos campagnes nationales 360° et en accompagnerez des projets à fort impact sur l&#39;acquisition, la rétention et la fidélisation de nos restaurants partenaires.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Descriptif du poste :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;En tant qu’Apprenti(e) dans l’équipe Marketing Merchant Restaurant, vous travaillerez au quotidien avec l&#39;équipe marketing chargée de mettre en avant toute la sélection de restaurants et de partenaires de Deliveroo. Vous serez également amené(e) à &lt;strong&gt;interagir régulièrement avec les autres départements marketing &lt;/strong&gt;tels que l’équipe média, l’équipe créative, le CRM ainsi qu’avec l’&lt;strong&gt;équipe commerciale.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions consisteront à:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mettre en avant sur l’application les restaurants et partenaires disponibles sur l’app.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Soutenir l’équipe commerciale dans la création et l’exécution de plans marketing destinés à mettre en avant les partenaires présents sur Deliveroo.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborer étroitement avec l&#39;équipe commerciale et les équipes marketing transversales (marque, réseaux sociaux, CRM et influenceurs) pour développer et exécuter des plans partenaires basés sur les priorités commerciales (par exemple, objectifs régionaux, accords d&#39;exclusivité, renégociations).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Préparer des présentations et des supports pour appuyer les discussions de l&#39;équipe commerciale avec les partenaires, en veillant à l&#39;alignement et à la clarté.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribuer à l’exécution des points forts des partenaires en collaboration avec le CRM et le Commercial (communications mensuelles d&#39;exclusivité / bannières dédiées sur l’application / notifications push...).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gérer le budget alloué pour le plan de chaque partenaire, en optimisant les ressources locales pour obtenir un impact maximal.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyser l’impact de nos campagnes pour en tirer des recommandations pour les équipes commerciales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Cette alternance vous permettra d&#39;appréhender de nombreux sujets marketing (création de campagne, analyse, sensibilité client) et vous permettra d&#39;acquérir une bonne connaissance des enjeux marketing et de la gestion de projets complexes grâce à la collaboration transverse que vous aurez avec les autres pôles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ce qui vous permettra de réussir&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous préparez un diplôme de niveau Bac+4 ou Bac+5 en école de commerce, université ou équivalent, avec une spécialisation en marketing, communication ou digital et recherchez une alternance d&#39;une durée d&#39;un an à partir de Décembre 2026 / Janvier 2027.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vous Vous Reconnaissez Dans Les Points Suivants&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes organisé·e, rigoureux·se et savez gérer plusieurs projets en parallèle en respectant les délais&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous avez une excellente communication écrite et orale en français ainsi qu&#39;un bon niveau d&#39;anglais.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes à l&#39;aise avec les chiffres et aimez analyser les performances pour en tirer des recommandations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous appréciez le travail en équipe et la coordination de nombreux interlocuteurs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vous êtes curieux·se, proactif·ve et souhaitez évoluer dans un environnement dynamique et en forte croissance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Voici un&lt;a href=&quot;https://sites.google.com/deliveroo.co.uk/biz-interview-guide/home?authuser=0&quot;&gt; lien&lt;/a&gt; avec de la documentation pour vous préparer aux entretiens.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous offrons un environnement de travail dynamique et stimulant, où vous aurez l&#39;opportunité de développer vos compétences et de contribuer activement à notre mission. Rejoignez notre équipe exceptionnelle dès maintenant et faites partie de cette aventure passionnante !&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;La vie chez Deliveroo :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Notre équipe est en forte croissance, notre impact très important, et nous cherchons à répondre aux questions les plus stimulantes du moment. Nous progressons rapidement, nous explorons toujours de nouvelles idées et nous sommes très transparents quant aux décisions que nous prenons et à ce qui motive nos choix.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Il y a tellement de questions que nous souhaitons résoudre, et encore plus que nous n&#39;avons pas encore rencontrées. Comment les données et la technologie peuvent-elles aider les restaurants à développer leur activité à mesure que les habitudes des consommateurs évoluent ? Comment pouvons-nous prédire ce qu&#39;une personne souhaitera pour dîner avant même que l&#39;idée ne lui vienne à l&#39;esprit ? Chez Deliveroo, ces questions ne sont que quelques-uns des défis ambitieux auxquels nous nous efforçons de répondre – et il n&#39;y a aucun projet qui ne peut pas devenir le vôtre. Aucune solution n&#39;appartient à une équipe en particulier, ce qui vous ouvre d&#39;extraordinaires possibilités en termes de développement et d&#39;impact personnel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;À compétences égales, ce poste est ouvert aux travailleurs et travailleuses en situation de handicap ou assimilés au sens de l’article L5212-13 du Code du travail. Deliveroo s’engage en faveur de la diversité, l’égalité professionnelle, l’emploi des personnes en situation de handicap.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity and Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;At Deliveroo, we know that a great workplace reflects the world around us and that true diversity and inclusion make us stronger, more creative, and better at what we do. We’re committed to fostering an environment where everyone can do their best work and feel they belong.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in equality of opportunity and welcome candidates from all backgrounds regardless of age, gender, ethnicity, disability, sexual orientation, gender identity, socio-economic background, religion, or belief.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a disability or long-term health condition and need support to apply for one of our roles, or require any reasonable adjustments during the recruitment process, you’ll have the opportunity to let us know once you’ve submitted your application. We’ll share details on how to request support so we can ensure you have a fair and equitable experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re excited about making a real impact in a fast-moving marketplace and growing your career alongside ambitious, supportive teams, we’d love to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DASH Brands will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about DASH Brands&#39; legitimate recruiting process at&lt;/em&gt; &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _2rkolb4i _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.fr/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in France</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;Deliveroo is now part of DoorDash, bringing together teams with even greater reach, scale, and ambition. Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Join us in our mission to transform the way people shop and eat. DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt now operate as one global company. Behind the AI experiences millions of people use every day, from shopping assistants to customer support agents, sits one shared Generative AI platform. Our team builds it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a Staff Product Manager in London to own major parts of that platform. Your customers are the engineers and ML researchers across all three brands who build AI products and agents. You&#39;ll work with engineering and product leaders in Europe and the US, and your decisions will shape how AI gets built across every market we operate in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Be Doing&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Set the strategy and roadmap&lt;/strong&gt; for core parts of our GenAI platform: model access and routing, agent infrastructure, and evaluation and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build one platform for three brands.&lt;/strong&gt; Spot the patterns across Deliveroo, Wolt and DoorDash teams and turn them into shared building blocks, so a capability built once reaches every market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our model portfolio&lt;/strong&gt; across frontier and open-weight models. Decide where we build, buy or partner in an ecosystem that changes month to month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make agents production-ready.&lt;/strong&gt; Give teams safe access to company knowledge, tools and systems, with the quality, latency and cost controls needed to run agents at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the evaluation strategy&lt;/strong&gt; so teams can prove quality before launch and keep improving it after.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay close to your customers.&lt;/strong&gt; Work with the teams shipping AI experiences, measure adoption and time-to-production, and let real production use drive the roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead at a senior level, &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;presenting to senior technical leadership and influence strategy beyond your own roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What You&#39;ll Need to Thrive&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate brings deep expertise in some of these areas and curiosity to grow in others:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant product management experience (typically 8+ years, or equivalent), including owning a technical platform, developer product, or ML or data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with LLM-based products or platforms in production, such as assistants, agents, evaluation or inference. GenAI platforms are a young field, so we care more about depth than years.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A platform mindset. You notice the problem five teams keep solving and turn it into one capability everyone can use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to go deep with engineers and ML researchers, then explain the trade-off in plain language to a senior leader.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of leading large, ambiguous areas on your own and aligning stakeholders across companies, countries and time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with regular overlap with US time zones, including some late-afternoon and evening calls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What Success Looks Like&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A team in any of our three brands can go from idea to a reliable AI product dramatically faster. That happens because the hard parts (models, inference, evaluation, tooling, observability, governance and agent infrastructure) are solved once at the platform layer and get better for everyone.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real scale from day one.&lt;/strong&gt; Your platform powers AI used by millions of consumers, merchants and couriers across three brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Frontier work, real constraints.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll work with the latest models and agent patterns, then make them reliable, affordable and compliant in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Visible impact.&lt;/strong&gt; Platform decisions here get reviewed by senior leadership and adopted across the company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re food lovers, problem solvers, community builders and more, brought together by a shared drive to make things better. Working here you can expect to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🔧 Solve meaningful problems at real scale Work on a complex, always-on marketplace that impacts millions every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌱 See your impact, fast Ship, test and improve ideas quickly in a low-hierarchy, high-ownership environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🧠 Grow through challenge and ownership Take on big, ambiguous problems and accelerate your career with strong support.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌎 A culture built for builders High standards, collaboration, flexible working and continuous learning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 Share in the success you help create Competitive salary and equity options, so you’re rewarded for the impact you make.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;➡️ Want a deeper look at how we build? Check out our &lt;a href=&quot;https://deliveroo.engineering/&quot;&gt;Tech Blog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a fair process that lets your skills shine—our interview typically includes 3-4 stages. Find more about how we hire &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.deliveroo.co.uk/how-we-hire/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Our Global Structure&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depending on your role, you may collaborate with teammates, systems, and leaders across DoorDash, Deliveroo and Wolt. Together, we’re unlocking new possibilities as one global team.&lt;/p&gt;
