&lt;li&gt;Experience working with CRMs, project management tools, task management tools, or other digital business platforms - Advantage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team player!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Challenge seeker!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self learner and independent!&lt;/li&gt;
