&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll be a great fit if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have strong back-end software engineering experience with the JVM ecosystem (Java, Kotlin, Spring Boot)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have hands-on experience using AI-assisted coding tools and are comfortable integrating them into your daily workflow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have significant experience navigating integration complexity across large partner networks and diverse legacy systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have a&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;&quot;user first&quot; mindset&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and are committed to building secure, well-tested, and pragmatic code — you bring a strong testing culture and care deeply about code quality and system resiliency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are proactive, curious, and eager to grow alongside your teammates through pair programming and cross-team collaboration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Are fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;whitespace-pre-wrap break-words font-normal first:pt-0 last:pb-0 py-1 @md:pt-2 @md:pb-[10px] @md:leading-relaxed text-base leading-relaxed text-foreground&quot;&gt;&lt;strong class=&quot;font-semibold text-foreground&quot;&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;pb-2 flex flex-col gap-1 list-disc pl-6 text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have experience with Ruby on Rails&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;break-words text-foreground text-base leading-relaxed&quot;&gt;Have contributed to large-scale platform architecture discussions or technical roadmap planning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
